{
    "description": "identuum-idp-oss OIDC basic certification (local conformance harness)",
    "alias": "identuum-oss",
    "server": {
        "discoveryUrl": "__OP_ISSUER__/.well-known/openid-configuration",
        "login_hint": "conformance-user@conformance.test"
    },
    "client": {
        "client_id": "__CLIENT1_ID__",
        "client_secret": "__CLIENT1_SECRET__"
    },
    "client_secret_post": {
        "client_id": "__CLIENT3_ID__",
        "client_secret": "__CLIENT3_SECRET__"
    },
    "client2": {
        "client_id": "__CLIENT2_ID__",
        "client_secret": "__CLIENT2_SECRET__"
    },
    "browser": [
        {
            "comment": "OP-native ceremony (THE-PKCE-DECISION): an unauthenticated /oauth/authorize 302s the browser to /api/v1/auth/browser-login (login form: inputs name=email/password, one submit button), then /api/v1/oauth/consent renders approve/deny submit buttons named 'action', then the suite callback. The 'Expect direct error' task covers modules whose CORRECT outcome is the OP refusing without a redirect (an unregistered redirect_uri renders a 200 HTML error page at the authorize URL — HtmlUnit throws on 4xx) — it waits for the error body and satisfies the module's screenshot placeholder. 'Verify Complete' is optional AND its match is ANCHORED to the callback origin: task matches use Spring simpleMatch, and a '*/test/...' pattern also matches the AUTHORIZE URL because the callback string appears inside the redirect_uri query parameter — that mis-match ran the 10s submission_complete wait on the error page and interrupted every expected-refusal module (measured, THE-PKCE-DECISION run 4). An expected-refusal module never reaches the callback; a happy-path module that fails to reach it still fails its own conditions, so no verdict is weakened.",
            "match": "__OP_ISSUER__/api/v1/oauth/authorize*",
            "tasks": [
                {
                    "task": "Second login screenshot (prompt=login)",
                    "optional": true,
                    "match": "__OP_ISSUER__/api/v1/auth/browser-login?return_to=*&prompt=login",
                    "commands": [
                        ["wait", "xpath", "//*", 10, ".*", "update-image-placeholder-optional"]
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "task": "Second login screenshot (max_age)",
                    "optional": true,
                    "match": "__OP_ISSUER__/api/v1/auth/browser-login*max_age*",
                    "commands": [
                        ["wait", "xpath", "//*", 10, ".*", "update-image-placeholder-optional"]
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "task": "Login",
                    "optional": true,
                    "match": "__OP_ISSUER__/api/v1/auth/browser-login*",
                    "commands": [
                        ["wait", "xpath", "//*", 10, ".*"],
                        ["text", "name", "email", "conformance-user@conformance.test", "optional"],
                        ["text", "name", "password", "__USER_PASSWORD__", "optional"],
                        ["click", "xpath", "//button[@type='submit']"]
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "task": "Consent",
                    "optional": true,
                    "match": "__OP_ISSUER__/api/v1/oauth/consent*",
                    "commands": [
                        ["click", "xpath", "//button[@name='action'][@value='approve']"]
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "task": "Expect direct error",
                    "optional": true,
                    "match": "__OP_ISSUER__/api/v1/oauth/authorize*",
                    "commands": [
                        ["wait", "xpath", "//*", 10, "error", "update-image-placeholder"]
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "task": "Verify Complete",
                    "optional": true,
                    "match": "https://localhost.emobix.co.uk:8443/test/a/identuum-oss/callback*",
                    "commands": [
                        ["wait", "id", "submission_complete", 10]
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
